:: Block Diagram ::

System (consists) accelerator and post-processing block
  "    (source) of AXI-stream data
  "    (source-of) Inference output in the form of AXI-stream

AXI-Stream data (repr) input image

input image (setof) 416 x 416 pixels

Inference output (consists) 13 row_det signals and detect_valid bit

13 row_det signals (repr) 13 x 13 grid 

each row_det (consists) 13 bits each

each grid (repr) 13 x 13 pixels

each grid predicition (ass) high detect_valid 

// MORE INTO THE SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

neural network (abbrev) NN
  "    (use-for) object-detection
  "    (called) Low-Precesion You-Only-Look-Once in System

Low-Precesion You-Only-Look-Once (abbrev) LPYOLO

accelerator (called) streamingdataflowpartition
    "        (bfr)  post-processing block
    "       (suppl) post-processing block with raw detection bytes of the NN core computations
    "       (genby) FINN Framework

FINN Framework (gen) Hardware IP for NN
    "          (crtd) Xilinx Reasearch Lab

post-processing module (called) yolo_post

yolo_post (implorg) Verilog

Verilog (enables) good resource control
  "     (support) higher throughput 

raw detection bytes (bwd) accelerator

yolo_post (do) processing on raw detection bytes 

third of raw detection bytes (repr) probability of class and objectness score

class and objectness score (repr-by) two bytes for each anchor box
          "                (det)  the presence of cars when multiplied together

NN output (contain) three anchor box

:: Implementation ::

Jupyter Notebooks (use-for) most of the implementation flow

Colab Cloud (use-for) training and exporting

After training the NN, trained model (derive) QONNX file

QONNX file (repr) quantized NN
  "        (delivaddr) FINN for the transformations

transformations (involves) elimination floating point operations and NN layers to Hardware Conversions
      
FINN Framework (enables) transformations checking 

transformations checking (sh-precede) IP generation

Parallelism degree of the accelerator  (det-by) configurations (dec-by) designer

post-processing (handle-by) yolo_post

yolo_post (involves) no floating point operations 

